    Sensor -->|Kirim Suhu & Kelembapan via API Key| Ingest
    Ingest --> MetricStore
    Ingest --> Eval
    Eval -->|Jika Suhu > 27C atau < 18C| AlarmStore
    
    AlarmStore -.->|Tampilkan Active Alarms| DashView
    MetricStore -.->|Grafik Tren Suhu & Kelembapan| TeleView

    Camera -->|Stream RTMP/HLS| CctvProbe
    CctvProbe -->|Enkripsi URL & Cek Status Online| CctvStore
    CctvStore -.->|Playback HLS Langsung ke Browser| CctvView
